{"recordId":"general_高延宗_917939298","name":"高延宗","type":"general","dynasty":"南北朝","title":"晉陽困獸","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"高延宗","pageId":911981,"revisionId":91580207,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-02-18T16:14:35Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%AB%98%E5%BB%B6%E5%AE%97","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91580207","wikidataId":"Q703350","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"《新出魏晋南北朝墓志疏证 (修订版)》","url":null,"type":"citation-template","template":"Cite book","author":"罗新，叶炜著","publisher":"中华书局","date":"2016.5","isbn":"978-7-101-11639-7","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"北史·卷三十三·列传第二十一","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"北齐书·卷三十七·列传第二十九","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"北史·卷五十六·列传第四十四","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"新出魏晋南北朝墓志疏证 (修订版)","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:38:05.169Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:zhoushu","source:beishi","source:zizhitongjian"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:zhoushu-24e7075a9475b753","query":"高延宗","count":2,"offset":6000,"excerpt":"是齊之將帥，降者相繼。封其特進、開府賀拔伏恩為郜國公，其餘官爵各有差。\n\n戊午，高延宗僭即偽位，改年德昌。己未，軍次幷州。庚申，延宗擁兵四萬出城抗拒，帝率諸軍合戰，齊人退，帝乘勝逐北，率千餘騎入東門，詔諸軍繞城置陣。至夜，延宗率其眾排陣而前，城中","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:beishi-cccc146eb8833b2e","query":"高延宗","count":2,"offset":8297,"excerpt":"并州，自將輕騎走鄴。是日，詔齊王公以下，示以逆順之道，於是齊將帥降者相繼。戊午，高延宗僭即偽位，改年曰德昌。己未，軍次并州。帝帥諸軍合戰，齊人退，帝遂北入城東門，諸軍繞城置陣。至夜，延宗帥其眾排陣而前，城中軍卻，人相蹂踐，大為延宗所敗。齊人欲閉門","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-cb6a71da5c416147","query":"高延宗","count":1,"offset":9151,"excerpt":"\n\n丙寅，周主出齊宮中珍寶服玩及宮女二千人，班賜將士，加立功者官爵各有差。周主問高延宗以取鄴之策，辭曰：「此非亡國之臣所及。」強問之，乃曰：「若任城工據鄴，臣不能知。若今主自守，陛下兵不血刃。」癸酉，周師趣鄴，命齊王憲先驅，以上柱國陳王純為并州總","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-17ffeba28c0cddc5","query":"高延宗","count":2,"offset":3186,"excerpt":"。戊申，封高緯為溫公，齊之諸王三十餘人，皆受封爵。周主與齊君臣飲酒，令溫公起舞。高延宗悲不自持，屢欲仰藥，其傅婢禁止之。\n\n周主以李德林為內史上士，自是詔誥格式用山東人物，並以委之。帝從容謂群臣曰：「我常日唯聞李德林名，復見其為齊朝作詔書移檄，正","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":4,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:zhoushu-24e7075a9475b753","bookId":"book:zhoushu","requestedTitle":"周書/卷06","title":"周書/卷06","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B706","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2589015","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B706?action=history","revisionId":2589015,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-08-09T15:20:06Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:48:01.926Z","sha256":"56e692442a8d6de36372d4e2cda898621880dc11f75d2706b2532b24521a5646","textSha256":"4c372efa831999d17f2f2c98c0d16904b38f6528f4c0dbf7210868b254fce179","expandedWikitextSha256":"56e692442a8d6de36372d4e2cda898621880dc11f75d2706b2532b24521a5646","characters":12268,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/zhoushu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:37.384Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness